TI  - The siderophore-iron transporter BbMirB is required for the fungal pathogen &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt; to repress insect immunity and promote proliferation during colonization of hemocoel
AU  - Zhu, Chenhua
