TI  - Expressing Parasitoid Venom Protein VRF1 in an Entomopathogen <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> Enhances Virulence toward Cotton Bollworm <i>Helicoverpa armigera</i>
AU  - Zeng, Shuocheng
AU  - Lin, Zhe
