TI  - Sub-Lethal Effects of Partially Purified Protein Extracted from <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> (Balsamo) and Its Presumptive Role in Tomato (<i>Lycopersicon esculentum</i> L.) Defense against Whitefly (<i>Bemisia tabaci</i> Genn.)
