TI  - Synergic effects of some plant-derived essential oils and Iranian isolates of entomopathogenic fungus <i>Metarhizium anisopliae</i> Sorokin to control <i>Acanthoscelides obtectus</i> (Say) (Coleoptera: Chrysomelidae)
