AB  - Attractant (M99-1) was used to trap M. alternatus, the result indicated that the occurrence peak of the adult M. ahernatus were from Jul. 12 to Aug. 1 in Xuancheng. A joint application technique of atrractant and non-woven fabric bands impregnated with B. bassiana was employed to control M. alternatus. Through analyse of several indexes, the result shows that B. bassiana has obvious restrain effect on M. alternatus , especially the effect of joint application of non-woven fabric bands impregnated with B. bassiana and trapping apparatus reach its tiptop. Infection rate reached 52.1%, inhibition rates of oviposition scars and beetle longevity were 39.13% and 40.1%, number of invasion holes declined by 7.75%, and larva number declined by 12.43%.
