TI  - Coffee berry borer (Hypothenemus hampei) (Coleoptera: Curculionidae) development across an elevational gradient on Hawai'i Island: Applying laboratory degree-day predictions to natural field populations
AU  - Hamilton, Lindsey J
AU  - Hollingsworth, Robert G
