TI  - Dual Transcriptomics Reveals Interspecific Interactions between the Mycoparasite &lt;i&gt;Calcarisporium cordycipiticola&lt;/i&gt; and Its Host &lt;i&gt;Cordyceps militaris&lt;/i&gt;
